Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.39,0:05:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,《正义联盟》
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.77,0:06:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,(克拉克·约瑟夫·肯特)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.44,0:06:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,(抵押品 赎回权取消 房屋出售 归银行所有)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.79,0:06:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,(他们回到自己的星球了吗)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.42,0:07:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,(我努力了)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.57,0:15:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.56,0:39:36.10,ZhuShi,,0,0,0,,(戴安娜·普林斯)
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.00,1:07:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,(拉克·约瑟夫·肯特)
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.94,1:09:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,(星际实验室个人档案 韦斯利·罗 军警)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.59,0:12:20.71,ZhuShi,,0,0,0,,我感觉不管怎么样 这钱最后他都得给我
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.64,0:39:41.60,ZhuShi,,0,0,0,,(为什么你和布鲁斯·韦恩都在找我)
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.67,0:39:48.61,ZhuShi,,0,0,0,,(我还知道你们的另一重身份)
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.28,0:39:53.53,ZhuShi,,0,0,0,,(曾经是)
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.66,0:39:59.12,ZhuShi,,0,0,0,,(你正在和我谈)
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.42,0:40:05.67,ZhuShi,,0,0,0,,(我凭什么相信你)
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.99,0:46:51.78,ZhuShi,,0,0,0,,尤里
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.03,0:46:54.95,ZhuShi,,0,0,0,,别弄了，它已经坏了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.88,1:01:38.75,ZhuShi,,0,0,0,,我们得走了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.75,1:01:40.25,ZhuShi,,0,0,0,,不  我们在这里很安全
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.09,1:01:43.59,ZhuShi,,0,0,0,,食物吃完了怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.34,1:01:45.63,ZhuShi,,0,0,0,,会有人来的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.97,1:01:47.55,ZhuShi,,0,0,0,,谁会来救我们
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.57,1:14:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.57,1:33:23.53,ZhuShi,,0,0,0,,他们飞走了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.54,1:33:29.37,ZhuShi,,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.16,1:33:30.87,ZhuShi,,0,0,0,,走  我们出去
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.11,1:41:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.66,0:00:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,他在那呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There he is!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.89,0:00:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,超人 超人 我们能问你几个问题吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Superman! Superman! Can we ask you some questions?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.61,0:01:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们要做播客 - 那好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's for our podcast. - Well, in that case...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.07,0:01:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你一共救过多少人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many people that you saved... have you saved?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.56,0:01:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我… - 算了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I... - Never mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.79,0:01:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,那个标记代表希望吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does your thing really stand for hope?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.73,0:01:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,对 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. It does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.72,0:01:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,但是它看上去好像"S"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it looks like an "S".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.34,0:01:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 它本意是 本意是要弯曲 像一条河\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, it's meant to. It's meant to wind, like a river.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.10,0:01:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,它来了又走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It comes and goes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.56,0:01:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我父…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My fa...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.24,0:01:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我认识的一个人曾经说过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A man I knew, used to say...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.97,0:01:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,希望就像车钥匙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that hope is like a car keys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.52,0:01:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,很容易丢 但如果你用心去找\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Easy to lose, but if you dig around...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.37,0:01:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,它通常就在附近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...it's usually close by.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.16,0:01:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你跟河马搏斗过吗？- 这问题太蠢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did you ever fight a hippo? - That's dumb!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.56,0:01:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,但是河马是最危险的啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But hippos are the most deadly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.29,0:01:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你最喜欢地球的什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is... What's the best thing about planet Earth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.36,0:03:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.01,0:03:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 不要 等等 等等 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait! No, wait! Wait! Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.87,0:03:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,求求你 求求你老兄 求求你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please! Please, man! Please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.38,0:03:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要我怎样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want from me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.45,0:03:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,恐惧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.28,0:03:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,它们能闻到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They could smell it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.95,0:04:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.09,0:04:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是什么 - 一个侦察兵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What was that? - A scout.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.45,0:04:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,外太空来的？外星大军？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From space? Like an alien army?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.94,0:04:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,阿尔弗雷德 你看到这个了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alfred, are you seeing this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.93,0:04:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,看到了 符合其它目击事件的记录\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am. Matches the other sightings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.29,0:04:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这种图案在卢瑟的笔记里到处都是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that pattern is all over Luthor's notes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.43,0:04:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,把飞机准备好 我今晚就北上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prep the jet. I'm going north tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.83,0:04:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,好 是时候了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good. It's time, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.60,0:04:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这是因为他们知道他死了 对吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's because they know he's dead, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.43,0:05:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,超人 他走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Superman. He's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.38,0:05:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我们以后要指望谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where does that leave us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.69,0:08:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,把枪放下 马上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop your guns now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.13,0:08:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,请等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.77,0:08:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快走 快点 - 不要开枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Move it. Move! - Don't shoot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.21,0:08:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,蹲下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.44,0:08:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,让他们靠墙蹲成一排 安静点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Line them up along the wall. Keep them quiet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.00,0:09:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.63,0:09:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,赫斯提亚套索会迫使你说实话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The lasso of Hestia compels you to reveal the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.26,0:09:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,现在 告诉我你是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.45,0:09:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是一个小型复古主义恐怖分子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're a small group of reactionary terrorists.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.58,0:09:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我们知道 罪恶降临在了这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We know that sinners brought{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.84,0:09:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 瘟疫肆虐 - 为什么要挟持人质\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- on this plague of... - Why the hostages?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.06,0:09:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你来晚了 倒计时已经开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're too late. The countdown's already begun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.02,0:09:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,几分钟后 四个街区…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In a few minutes, 4 city blocks...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.56,0:09:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,"砰"全世界都会看到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}While the world watches.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.43,0:09:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,安静 闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.89,0:09:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,这是人类最后的希望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is man's best hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.25,0:09:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,和现代世界一起沉没吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Down with the modern world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.73,0:09:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,回到黑暗的年代\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back to the Dark Ages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.62,0:09:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,以及神圣的恐惧带来的安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the safety of holy fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.28,0:10:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这本来可以快速解决的 但是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This would've been over quickly, but...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.23,0:10:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Don't!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.76,0:10:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't believe it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.26,0:10:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你是什么 - 一个信徒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you? - A believer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.02,0:11:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我想求你们的帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm asking for your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.06,0:11:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我相信有一个陌生人 从海上来到这个村庄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe there's a stranger, comes to this village from the sea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.73,0:11:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,他在冬天 人们饥饿之时前来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He comes in the winter when the people are hungry...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.07,0:11:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,带着鱼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and brings fish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.67,0:11:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,他在大潮期间过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He comes on the king tide...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.89,0:11:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是昨晚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.87,0:11:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,港口那边有冰山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Icebergs in the harbour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.79,0:11:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,四个月没有船入港了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Four months since the last ship got through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.05,0:11:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,这个陌生人…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, this stranger...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.30,0:12:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,不是坐船来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doesn't come by ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.23,0:12:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,有敌人要来了 很远的地方来的敌人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are enemies coming, from far away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.24,0:12:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要战士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need warriors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.10,0:12:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我准备组建一支联盟 来保护我们自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm building an alliance, to defend ourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.18,0:12:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 如果你能让我现在见到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I'll give you $25,000 to...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.32,0:12:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我就给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}talk to this man right now...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.60,0:12:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,两万五千美元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}outside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.26,0:12:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我那三个盒子是什么 我给你三万\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me what those 3 boxes are and I'll make it 30.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.40,0:12:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该滚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should get out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.31,0:12:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你至少能告诉我亚特兰蒂斯在那吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you at least point me to Atlantis?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.85,0:12:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,亚瑟·库里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arthur Curry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.60,0:13:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是海洋守护神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Also known as the Protector of the Oceans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.52,0:13:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,海王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Aquaman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.30,0:13:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我听说你能和鱼说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hear you can talk to fish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.90,0:13:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,所以让我捋一捋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So let me get this straight...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.65,0:13:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你的做法是打扮成一个蝙蝠 一个真正的蝙蝠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You do it dressed like a bat? Like an actual bat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.33,0:13:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,20年来在哥谭都管用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's worked for 20 years in Gotham.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.29,0:13:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,就那个屎坑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, that shithole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.34,0:13:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,开战的时候 我们会需要你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fight comes, we'll need you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.24,0:13:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别抱太大希望 蝙蝠侠 - 为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't count on it, Batman. - Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.26,0:13:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我不喜欢你跑到这里来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I don't like you coming here...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.36,0:13:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,打探我的事情 干涉我的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}digging into my business, getting into my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.42,0:13:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,亚特兰蒂斯的人告诉我 干这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People from Atlantis tell me, "Do this."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.22,0:13:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你说 干那个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, you say, "Do that."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.54,0:13:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我想要一个人待着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to be left alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.85,0:13:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是为什么你在这个荒芜的地方帮助这些人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That why you help these people out here in the middle of nowhere?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.36,0:13:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你随时可以走开？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because you can just leave?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.06,0:13:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我帮他们是因为没有别人帮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I help them because no one else does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.44,0:13:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要保护他们 你就得和我一起干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanna protect them, you need to work with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.93,0:13:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,孤身一人才最强\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A strong man is strongest alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.89,0:13:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你听说过吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ever heard that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.26,0:13:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,根本没这句话 你把那句谚语说反了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not a saying. That's the opposite of what the saying is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.92,0:13:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,是 但不意味着我错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yep. Doesn't mean I'm wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.83,0:13:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你听说过超人吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ever hear of Superman?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.75,0:13:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他在和我一起战斗时牺牲了 - 我就是这个意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He died fighting next to me. - My point exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.06,0:14:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,那三个盒子里是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's in the 3 boxes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.15,0:14:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,是个古老的传说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's ancient history.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.17,0:14:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,人类融化了极地冰盖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mankind's melting the polar ice caps...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.39,0:14:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,毁灭了生态系统 所以他们活该？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Destroying the ecosystem, they got it coming?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.87,0:14:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 我才不介意海平面升高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, I don't mind if the ocean rise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.26,0:14:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,那沸腾的海洋呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about if they boil?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.74,0:14:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,打扮成个蝙蝠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dressed like a bat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.33,0:14:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你疯了吧 布鲁斯·韦恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're out of your mind, Bruce Wayne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.60,0:14:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,并不意味着我是错的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doesn't mean I'm wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.07,0:14:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 你说 你没法再联系上这个所谓的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, you say you have no way of reconnecting with this...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.46,0:14:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,海王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aquaman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.52,0:14:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我在他的外套里放了一个追踪器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I put a tracking device in his coat...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.80,0:14:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,可他没穿就走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He left without it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.48,0:14:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,也许那就不是他的外套\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It may, in fact, not have been his coat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.11,0:14:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,卢瑟笔记里的 那些方块\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those squares, from Luthor's notes...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.99,0:14:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得它们应该是某种容器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think they must be containers of some kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.22,0:14:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,装什么的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.55,0:14:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道 金钱 权利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. Money, power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.80,0:14:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,某种值得为此开战的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something worth starting a war over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.08,0:15:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我们在这个人这里还有点运气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, we had luck with one person...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.54,0:15:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,队伍名单上的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on the team list.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.40,0:15:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,巴里·艾伦 中心城的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Barry Allen, of Central City.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.63,0:15:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,他完全处于离线状态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's completely off the grid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.67,0:15:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,住在空建筑里 我觉得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Squatting, I think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.85,0:15:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,经常突然性搬家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moves suddenly and often.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.03,0:15:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 消失状态 - 但他还会拜访他父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Disappearing act? - But he does visit his father...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.01,0:15:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,去监狱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...in prison.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.36,0:15:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 因为他父亲谋杀了他的母亲 - 我的天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- For murdering his mother. - Jesus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.71,0:15:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,小巴里一直在保护他父亲的清白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Young Barry always protested his father's innocence...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.34,0:15:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,但他当时只有九岁 没人听他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he was 9 and nobody listened to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.76,0:15:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在监狱有人吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have somebody at the prison?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.12,0:15:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,有 我们会找到地址的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah. We'll find the address.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.99,0:15:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,那 戴安娜呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about, Diana?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.87,0:15:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你有她的电话号码\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you have her number.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.97,0:15:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以打给她的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could've called her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.48,0:15:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,要不要我立刻飞到巴黎 带上你的亲笔信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps I should fly to Paris with a handwritten note?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.99,0:15:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,"你愿不愿意做布鲁斯的队友？"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Will you be Bruce' teammate?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.85,0:15:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,"请选择 愿意或不愿意"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Check: Yes or No"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.55,0:15:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我只对她的能力感兴趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm only interested in her skill set.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.91,0:15:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你当然是了 - 能继续吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm sure you are. - Can we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.68,0:15:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这位的面部识别有点困难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, facial recognition's a bit dodgy on this one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.20,0:15:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,不过还是得到了部分匹配\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's got a partial match.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.06,0:15:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多·斯通\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A Victor Stone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.82,0:15:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,智商超高 拿着橄榄球奖学金上了哥谭市立大学\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Genius I.Q., football scholarship to GCU...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.69,0:16:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,而且 已去世了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And deceased.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.30,0:16:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,猜到了 童话和鬼故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Figures. Fairy tales and ghost stories.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.11,0:16:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,有点想念以前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One misses the days{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.53,0:16:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,当时我们最大的烦恼 不过是会爆炸的发条企鹅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when one's biggest concerns were exploding wind-up penguins?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.33,0:16:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,简单的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The simple life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.17,0:16:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经认不出这个世界了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't recognize this world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.04,0:16:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我不用认出它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't have to recognize it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.33,0:16:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我只需要拯救它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just have to save it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.82,0:16:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我来见亨利·艾伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here to see Henry Allen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.54,0:16:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,签名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sign.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.77,0:16:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 行不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry it up, will you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.39,0:16:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了 有问题吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, you got a problem?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.91,0:16:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不 没有问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. There's no problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.95,0:16:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,没有就对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Better not be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.68,0:16:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道该怎么走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know where to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.85,0:17:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你是必须戴眼镜…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are those prescription...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.07,0:17:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,还是就想看起来聪明点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or you just trying to look brainy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.77,0:17:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你在限制自己的能力 你一直在原地打转\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because you're holding yourself back. You're going in circles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.20,0:17:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你做着三个没有前途的工作 现在这是第四个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're working 3 dead-end jobs. Going on four.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.05,0:17:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你哪来的时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where do you even have the time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.37,0:17:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我会挤时间的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I make the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.30,0:17:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这一切 就为了支付刑事司法的学位的学费？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this is all to pay for a criminal justice degree, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.83,0:17:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我真的不想再讨论这个了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. I really don't want to talk about this again...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.20,0:17:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,当时调查简直一塌糊涂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The investigation was botched.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.07,0:17:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,把手给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me your hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.32,0:17:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我要你认真听我说 巴里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to listen to me, Barry...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.22,0:17:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我是认真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I mean this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.53,0:17:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我要你放弃这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to give all of that up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.44,0:17:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我要你不要继续来见我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I want you to stop coming to see me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.56,0:17:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是你生命中的累赘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am a drag on your life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.44,0:17:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,请别再对我说这样的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please don't ever say that to me again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.72,0:17:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,求你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.73,0:18:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以成为你想成为的一切 你那么聪明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can be whatever you wanna be. You're a brilliant man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.55,0:18:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对是精英中的精英\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Absolute best of the best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.41,0:18:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能呆在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't sit here...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.32,0:18:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,看着你在中城跑进跑出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and watch you run in place in Central City...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.22,0:18:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,为了一个老家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for some old dude...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.98,0:18:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,哪里都去不了的老家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who's not going anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.30,0:18:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 爸爸 这不是真的 - 是时候了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dad...That's not true. - It's time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.91,0:18:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这不是真的 - 放手吧 艾伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's not true. - Let's go, Allen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.93,0:18:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,艾伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Allen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.43,0:18:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我要你开创自己的未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to make your own future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.29,0:18:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不要活在过去 创造自己的未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Living in the past... Make your own future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.24,0:18:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,开门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open gate!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.33,0:18:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,实验室归你了 霍华德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lab's all yours, Howard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.99,0:18:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,十一点半 今晚挺早啊 塞拉斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}11:30. Early night for you, Silas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.49,0:18:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,对 挺早\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. Early.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.56,0:18:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我没机会告诉你…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never got to say...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.29,0:19:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我对这一切的发生很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm very sorry about what happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.46,0:19:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多是个好小伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Victor was a wonderful kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.85,0:19:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.16,0:19:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Victor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.54,0:19:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多 你不能就呆在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Victor, you're not stuck up here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.28,0:19:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以拥有人生 可以拥有比…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can have a life. You can have more than...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.90,0:19:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 如果你在这里胡思乱想… - 我在处理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- If you stay up here brooding... - I'm processing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.99,0:19:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以访问到一切数据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can access everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.50,0:19:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 但我无法把信息整合起来 - 还不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But I can't put it all together. - Not yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.15,0:19:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,但是如果你和我合作 如果我们有再造引擎…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if you work with me, if we had the change engines...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.80,0:19:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你还对其他人做了对我做的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you did to someone else. What you did to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.50,0:19:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不 母盒必须被藏起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. The box stays hidden.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.93,0:19:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你看到我们从那艘氪星船上学到了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you could see what we're learning from the Kryptonian ship...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.96,0:19:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我认为再造引擎可以感应它的能量…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think the change engine can integrate with its energy...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.84,0:19:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 可以升级… - 有谁知道吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- get it powered up... - Does anybody know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.72,0:20:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.43,0:20:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,实验室里 有谁知道我还活着吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At the lab... Does anybody know I'm alive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.69,0:20:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我…我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I... I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.59,0:20:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得你还没准备好…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't think you were ready for them to...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.06,0:20:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,准备什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.97,0:20:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,让他们看到怪物吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For them to see the monster?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.36,0:20:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是怪物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are not a monster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.18,0:20:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,真是奇怪 你竟然以为我在说自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's weird that you thought I meant me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.89,0:20:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我所做的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What I did...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.85,0:20:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,那场事故中 我失去了你妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I lost your mother in that accident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.30,0:20:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能再…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wasn't about to...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.67,0:20:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能再失去我的儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I couldn't bear to lose my son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.43,0:20:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,但你已失去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.83,0:20:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我脑子里有种我不会说的语言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got a language in my head that I don't speak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.94,0:20:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,不是数字信号 而是外星的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not just digital... It's alien.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.39,0:20:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,每一天 醒来 我都不一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyday, I wake up, different...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.88,0:20:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,在进化\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Modified.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.62,0:20:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.17,0:20:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,昨晚我还做不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Couldn't do that last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.82,0:21:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,自从氪星人拜访之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ever since we got visitors from Krypton,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.29,0:21:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,人们就在等待下一次外星入侵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}people have been waiting for the next alien invasion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.46,0:21:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我在想 如果我就是外星人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I got to wonder if I'm it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.81,0:22:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 今天有什么变化吗 - 没有 女王陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Any changes today? - No, my Queen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.30,0:22:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,母盒已经苏醒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Mother Box has awoken...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.40,0:22:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,但还没有什么事情发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yet, nothing has happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.21,0:22:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,母盒从远古开始 已经沉睡了几千年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It has slept for thousands of years, since the first age.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.55,0:22:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么现在突然苏醒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why did it wake at all?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.06,0:22:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,亚马逊族 准备战斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Amazons, on your mark!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.98,0:23:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,荒原狼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steppenwolf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.65,0:23:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,母亲…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mother...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.26,0:23:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我流放了数千年 一直在寻找…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Millenia in exile... Searching.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.65,0:23:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,今天 你终于让我回家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At last, you call me home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.81,0:23:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你不会喜欢你的欢迎仪式的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will not like your welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.98,0:23:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I think I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.18,0:23:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 召集军团 - 封锁牢房\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Gather the legions. - Seal the cage!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.36,0:24:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,快去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.19,0:24:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,右翼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flank right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.80,0:24:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.36,0:24:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,跑吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.69,0:24:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,封锁大门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seal the gates!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.10,0:24:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,别停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep it moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.68,0:25:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,拿到了 走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got it! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.54,0:26:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,尊贵的女王 为何要反抗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Noble Queen, why do you fight?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.45,0:26:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,统一之力完成后 你将会加入我的军团\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After the Unity, you will join my Legion...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.55,0:26:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,到时你会明白权力就是正义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you will know the righteousness of power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.74,0:26:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你会爱上我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will love me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.69,0:26:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你们全部都会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You all will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.98,0:26:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须点燃古代的烽火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to light the ancient warning fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.78,0:27:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,烽火有五千年没有燃起了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fire has not burned for 5,000 years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.13,0:27:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,人类不会明白它的意思的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Men won't know what it means.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.96,0:27:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,人类不会…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Men won't...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.09,0:27:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,但是她会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But she will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.95,0:27:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说 戴安娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to me, Diana.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.10,0:27:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你这个周末干嘛了 戴安娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you do this weekend, Diana?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.73,0:27:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.27,0:27:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,没做什么特别有趣的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing very interesting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.22,0:27:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你每次都这么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's all you ever tell us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.33,0:27:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我能怎么说呢 我是个无趣的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whay can I say? I'm not that exciting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.29,0:27:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,亚马逊人的神殿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Shrine of the Amazons...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.16,0:28:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,巨大的烽火 就在我身后燃烧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}an enormous bonfire burned right behind me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.02,0:28:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,让大家都百思不得其解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}baffling absolutely everyone...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.12,0:28:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不管是当地人 还是政府官员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from locals, to government authorities alike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.28,0:28:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 烽火在几英里之外都可以看到… - 入侵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The fire could be seen for miles on end... - Invasion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.39,0:28:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,当地新闻…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the local scene...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.03,0:28:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这位清洁工的妻子信誓旦旦的说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This janitor's wife had some strong words...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.43,0:28:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,是那些外星人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for the aliens she says,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.43,0:28:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,偷走了她的丈夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}stole her man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.27,0:28:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我家霍华德是个好人 是家里的支柱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My Howard is a good man. He's a provider.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.15,0:28:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,那些外星人是要在他的(消音)插探测仪吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And these aliens are gonna (beep) probe him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.08,0:28:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你要敢来湖景公寓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come down to the Lakeview...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.68,0:28:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我他妈要把又粗又大的探测仪插到你的(消音)去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'll stick a (beep) probe up your alien (beep) ass, you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.46,0:28:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我找到个小地方 餐馆旁边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I found a little place. By the diner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.69,0:28:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,挺适合我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suits me just fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.27,0:28:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么不早说呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish you'd said something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.79,0:28:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我只是欠了点账而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no. I got behind in the payments.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.25,0:28:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道银行的 欠一毛钱都会紧追不放\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you know the banks. Jump like a cougar if you miss by a dime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.77,0:28:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,那地方反正对我来说也太大了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Place was too big for me anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.80,0:28:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,空荡荡的房子里像个鬼魂一样游荡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shuffling around like an old ghost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.08,0:28:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你早说的话我可以找人帮你 或者…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I might have been able to, talk to someone, or...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.41,0:28:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你的事情够多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You had enough to deal with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.83,0:28:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,没必要让你为婆婆操心了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't need to add mother-in-law to the list.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.90,0:29:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 虽然不是正式的… - 嘿 莲恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Not that I was ever... - Hey, Lane...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.73,0:29:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你的线人是谁 大学里那个激进主义者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is your source? The activist in that university...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.70,0:29:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 是我的线人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, it's my source.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.30,0:29:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,他们要我写那个绑架案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got tapped for the kidnapping story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.75,0:29:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,只不过就是一些学生游行 总之…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There were all those student protests. Anyway...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.51,0:29:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得这是政治的事情 所以 你的线人是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm thinking it's political, so... Who's your guy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.48,0:29:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我看看她接不接电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well let's see if she'll take your call.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.20,0:29:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,原来是个女的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, it's a she.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.50,0:29:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不是女的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not a she.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.92,0:29:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,看来你得忙那个故事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sounds like you should be working that story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.04,0:29:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我… 我还没准备好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm... I'm not ready yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.24,0:29:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在很开心 写点小猫美容的新闻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm perfectly happy, doing fluff pieces about kitten grooming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.92,0:29:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,调节一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For a while...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.52,0:29:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,回来了 还是有些困难的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was hard coming back here at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.48,0:29:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我现在新闻都看不下去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well. I can hardly read the news anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.53,0:29:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,都太悲伤了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So much bitterness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.86,0:29:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 我想都是因为他走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Course, I think it's all because he's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.01,0:29:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不过估计母亲都这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I suppose a mother does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.83,0:30:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,但是也不是说你要报道的事情就少了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's not like there's any less that needs reporting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.94,0:30:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉克保证过 你还会再拿一个普利策奖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Clark promised me, you were gonna bring home another Pulitzer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.86,0:30:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是吗 - 当然 他说过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, did he? - Oh, yes. He did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.25,0:30:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,他说你是他见过最饥渴的女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said you were the thirstiest young woman he'd ever met.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.95,0:30:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 最饥饿 - 饥饿 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hungriest. - Hungry. Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.61,0:30:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他说你…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.97,0:30:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你的新闻嗅觉是比他的听觉还灵敏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}could smell a story. Further away than he could hear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.98,0:30:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,好的故事 都是有原因的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well stories, made sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.84,0:30:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这不只是谜题 这更是有关真相\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was more than just a puzzle. It was about the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.92,0:30:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,要看到驱动世界的引擎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was about seeing the engine of the world...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.77,0:30:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,趁它还在转\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}While it still ran.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.07,0:30:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多·斯通\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Victor Stone...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.14,0:30:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,已去世\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deceased.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.80,0:31:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,就是它…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That one...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.62,0:31:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,可以确定这就是让外星人发狂的东西了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pretty sure that's what made the alien go crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.16,0:31:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我会考虑在战衣上加点东西的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll see about weaving something to the suit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.58,0:31:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,得花一点时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Won't be quick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.52,0:31:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,只要能给我点胜算就行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything to give me an edge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.30,0:31:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,要知道 我可花了几百万美元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I paid millions of dollars...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.29,0:31:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,来建造这栋大楼的安保系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for this building's security.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.75,0:31:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,对 看起来就很贵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. It looked expensive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.99,0:32:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.43,0:32:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,新玩具吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A new toy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.81,0:32:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,军队运输机 原型机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prototype troop carrier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.62,0:32:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我曾经认识一个男人 他肯定很想开这玩意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I once knew a man who would've loved to fly it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.96,0:32:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,对 我们需要的不仅仅是个飞行员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well we're gonna need more than a pilot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.31,0:32:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得敌人要来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think there's an attack coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.11,0:32:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,不是要来 布鲁斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not coming, Bruce.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.19,0:32:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,是已经来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's already here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.31,0:32:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,他们称他为荒原狼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They called him Steppenwolf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.36,0:32:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,世界的终结者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The End of Worlds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.76,0:32:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,他为征服而生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He lived only to conquer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.35,0:32:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,数不清的人倒于他的屠刀之下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Millions fell before his blade...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.97,0:32:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,而后又以其类魔之身重现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And rose again as his Parademons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.66,0:32:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,噩梦般的生物 以恐惧为食\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nightmare creatures, who feed on fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.07,0:32:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,对 我可能遇到过一个 我们不太合得来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I think I've met one. We didn't hit it off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.29,0:32:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,在哥谭吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here in Gotham?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.52,0:32:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,他们到处都是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're all over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.84,0:32:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是在找他的什么盒子吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're looking for his... Boxes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.69,0:32:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 母盒 - 母盒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The Mother Boxes. - Mother Boxes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.70,0:32:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜荒原狼拿走了你们守护的那个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess Steppenwolf took the one you people were guarding,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.78,0:33:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这样还剩两个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that leaves two more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.47,0:33:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你挺厉害嘛 - 过奖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm impressed. - Don't be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.55,0:33:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道里面是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have no idea what's in them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.27,0:33:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,是武器吗？还是某种能量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A weapon? Some kind of power?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.94,0:33:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,它们并非蕴含能量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They don't contain power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.11,0:33:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,它们就是能量本身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.33,0:33:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,从一个星球传运到另一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carried from planet to planet...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.65,0:33:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,母盒合并之后就能形成统一之力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Mother Boxes combined to form the Unity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.01,0:33:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,那种灾难性的能量不仅可以毁灭世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An apocalyptic power that not only destroys worlds...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.75,0:33:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,还能把世界打回最原始的空壳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but transforms them into the primordial hell's gate...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.13,0:33:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,跟荒原狼出生地一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...of Steppenwolf's birthworld.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.67,0:33:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我们本该灭亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should have died...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.62,0:33:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们迸发出了自己的统一之力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we formed our own Unity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.40,0:33:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,亚马逊人 亚特兰蒂斯人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Amazons, Atlanteans...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.20,0:33:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人类部落并肩作战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All the tribes of man fought side by side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.37,0:33:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,传奇战士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Warriors of legend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.33,0:33:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,来自其他世界的盟友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Allies from other worlds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.21,0:33:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,就连众神也齐心协力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even the gods themselves all acted as one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.36,0:34:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,不惜献出生命将荒原狼击退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Laying down their lives to drive Steppenwolf away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.28,0:34:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,据说这让荒原狼恼羞成怒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some say it drove him mad...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.60,0:34:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,这是他第一次蒙受打败仗的耻辱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}.. the disgrace of his first retreat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.41,0:34:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他发誓我们的联盟会瓦解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He swore our alliance would crumble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.37,0:34:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,黑暗将再次笼罩地球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That darkness would cover the Earth...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.39,0:34:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,而黑暗降临之时 他就会再回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that he would return when it did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.32,0:34:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,留下的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Left behind...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.79,0:34:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,母盒母盒太过危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Mother Boxes were too dangerous{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.77,0:34:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对不能放在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to be kept together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.60,0:34:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,其中之一托付给亚马逊人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One was entrusted to the Amazons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.25,0:34:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,一个交于亚特兰蒂斯人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One, to the Atlanteans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.61,0:34:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,都封存在安全的要塞里 重兵把守\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Both sealed and guarded in secure strongholds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.62,0:34:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,人类之盒被秘密掩埋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Box of Man was buried in secret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.60,0:34:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,以确保没有部落能用它的能量攻击其他部落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So that no tribe would be tempted to use its power over another.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.07,0:35:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,巨大恐惧之后的和谐来之不易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Such harmony out of such horror.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.86,0:35:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,那可真是一个英雄辈出的时代\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was truly an age of heroes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.70,0:35:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得我们不可能再找回从前的团队了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something tells me we're not getting the band back together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.97,0:35:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,亚特兰蒂斯人被迫待在海底\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Atlanteans were forced under sea...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.21,0:35:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,而亚马逊人 藏于孤岛永不离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the Amazons, to an island they can never leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.39,0:35:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会依靠人类部落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't count on the tribes of men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.33,0:35:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我们总觉得末日闹钟还有个小睡模式一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We tend to act like the doomsday clock has a snooze button.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.12,0:35:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们还剩多久… - 几天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How long until we... - Days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.50,0:35:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,最多几天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At most.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.74,0:35:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,荒原狼上次的错误就是袭击我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steppenwolf's mistake last time was attacking us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.72,0:35:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,他想在毁灭我们之前让地球俯首称臣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wanted to make the Earth kneel before he destroyed us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.23,0:35:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这次他的目的只是想夺取母盒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This time he'll just go after the Boxes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.17,0:35:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我收到了我们一个新队员的地址\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got a location for one of our recruits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.54,0:35:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 巴里·艾伦 - 另一个呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Barry Allen. - What about the other one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.74,0:35:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多·斯通\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Victor Stone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.04,0:35:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望你能把他找出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was hoping you would dig him up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.23,0:35:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是在请陌生人拿自己的生命冒险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're asking people we don't know to risk their lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.17,0:35:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.70,0:35:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,事情就是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's how this works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.05,0:36:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,巴里·艾伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Barry Allen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.84,0:36:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,布鲁斯·韦恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bruce Wayne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.39,0:36:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你这么说得好像是在解释\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You say that like it explains...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.61,0:36:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么我家里来了个陌生人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}why there's a total stranger in my place...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.72,0:36:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,躲在黑漆漆的屋子里 坐在我第二喜欢的椅子上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}sitting in the dark, in my second favorite chair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.20,0:36:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我说说这个吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me about this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.98,0:36:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是个长得和我一模一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a person who looks exactly like me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.94,0:36:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,但是绝不是我的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but who is definitely not me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.63,0:36:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,很帅气的犹太小伙儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very attractive Jewish boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.62,0:36:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜猜 这个人偷了你的怀表吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody who, I don't know, stole your pocketwatch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.46,0:36:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,或者铁路？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or railroads?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.21,0:36:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你有超能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you have abilities.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.93,0:37:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是不清楚具体是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just don't know what they are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.26,0:37:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我的超能力包括…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My special skills include...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.12,0:37:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,拉中提琴 设计网页 精通手语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Viola, web design, fluent in sign language...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.82,0:37:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,大猩猩手语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}gorilla sign language...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.10,0:37:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,硅基石英纱织物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Silica-based quartz sand fabric,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.66,0:37:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,耐磨 耐热\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Abrasion resistant. Heat resistant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.70,0:37:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 是我参加冰舞比赛用的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I do...Competitive ice dancing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.91,0:37:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这是航天飞机返回大气层所需的阻燃材料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what they use on the space shuttle, to prevent it from burning up on re-entry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.32,0:37:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我参加非常激烈的冰舞比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do very competitive ice dancing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.35,0:37:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不管你要找的是谁 绝对不是我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoever you're looking for, it's not me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.48,0:37:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你是蝙蝠侠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the Batman?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.08,0:37:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你的超能力就是快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you're fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.19,0:37:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这么说似乎太笼统了点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That feels like an oversimplification.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.78,0:37:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我在组织一个队伍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm putting together a team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.50,0:37:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,将有超能力的人组建在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People with special abilities.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.69,0:38:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你看 我觉得敌人就要来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see, I believe enemies are coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.41,0:38:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,别说了 我加入\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop right there. I'm in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.81,0:38:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你加入吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.88,0:38:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,对 我需要 朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. I need... friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.11,0:38:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,人类很复杂 他们需要很多关注点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People are difficult. They require a lot of focus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.65,0:38:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的节奏我实在是没法理解…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They have like a rhythm that I haven't quite been able to...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.09,0:38:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,就像"早午餐"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like, Brunch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.05,0:38:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,比如说… 什么是早午餐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like... What is Brunch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.67,0:38:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你排队等一个小时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wait in line for an hour...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.45,0:38:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,拿到的明明就是午餐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for, essentially, lunch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.43,0:38:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说… 我也搞不清\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.33,0:38:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,人们就是… 有点慢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People are... a little slow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.18,0:38:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我尽量跟上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll try to keep up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.94,0:38:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这个能送我吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I keep this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.57,0:38:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以进入另一层维度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like this layer of dimensional reality...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.08,0:38:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,里面好像能操控时空\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that seems to manipulate space-time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.43,0:38:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我将其称之为速度力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I call it the Speed Force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.92,0:38:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,它让我每天都消耗巨多卡路里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Causes me to burn tremendous amount of calories...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.84,0:38:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我就是个零食黑洞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I am just a black hole of snacks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.62,0:38:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我是个"零食洞"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am a "snack hole."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.26,0:38:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这个特殊战斗小队有多少人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many people are on this special fight team?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.39,0:38:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,三个 加上你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three. Including you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.80,0:38:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,三个？敌人是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three? Against what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.47,0:38:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我在飞机上和你慢慢说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll tell you on the plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.65,0:38:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,飞机？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Plane?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.30,0:39:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你的超能力是什么来着？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are your superpowers again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.87,0:39:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我有钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm rich.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.69,0:39:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,每次播放这段录像 电脑就抽风\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The program always gets twitchy with this footage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.63,0:39:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我们是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know who we are?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.75,0:39:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你是维克多·斯通吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you Victor Stone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.62,0:39:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我得和你谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to speak to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.15,0:40:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不 面对面那种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, face to face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.96,0:40:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,在这上面 我很传统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm old-fashioned that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.67,0:40:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我打算伤害你 我在湖边就动手了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I was going to attack you, I would've done it by the lake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.01,0:40:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来你有约会了 普林斯女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like you have a date, Ms. Prince.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.41,0:40:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,这里有个人很久没约会了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About time somebody here did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.67,0:40:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,面对面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Face to face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.13,0:40:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直在追踪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been doing some tracking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.28,0:41:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你想找的东西待在盲区里面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you're looking for is sticking to the dead zones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.54,0:41:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,一旦它现身 能量泄漏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It gets in front of a camera, causes a surge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.31,0:41:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我会让你知道的 - 那不够好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll let you know. - That's not good enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.64,0:41:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不够好？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not good enough?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.42,0:41:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,对你而言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.48,0:41:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我不认识你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I don't know you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.44,0:41:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道你怎么得到这些馈赠的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I don't know how you got these gifts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.47,0:41:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,馈赠？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gifts?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.42,0:41:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你能做到的事没人可以做到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one else can do what you do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.37,0:41:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,如果这是馈赠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, if these are gifts...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.09,0:41:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么只有我付出代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then why am I the one paying for them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.93,0:41:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要你 维克多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need you, Victor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.85,0:41:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,也许你也需要我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And maybe you need us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.13,0:41:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得我一个人就挺好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be fine alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.84,0:41:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,很久以前我也是这么对自己说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told myself the same for a long time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.62,0:41:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我曾经失去了我最爱的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I lost someone I loved once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.21,0:41:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我把自己封闭起来…谁也不见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shut myself off from... From everyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.33,0:41:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,但我必须学会重新敞开心扉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I had to learn to open back up again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.38,0:41:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,事实上 我现在还在努力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The truth is I'm still working on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.49,0:42:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,既然你同意见我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if you agreed to meet me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.18,0:42:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,意味着你也同样在努力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you're working on it, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.66,0:42:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我 维克多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trust me, Victor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.25,0:42:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,求救 求救\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mayday! Mayday!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.00,0:42:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,有东西从空中飞下来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something came down from the sky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.42,0:42:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,快救救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.49,0:42:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,威士忌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whisky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.12,0:42:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,给他也倒一杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And one for Ahab there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.25,0:42:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,从空中而来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...from the sky...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.21,0:42:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我听到一声巨响\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I heard a cannon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.52,0:42:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那不过是大海的怒吼 - 他们来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's ocean's rage. - Then they came...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.66,0:42:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,从天上来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Monsters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.74,0:43:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,怪物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...from the sky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.26,0:43:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,撕碎了我的船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tore right through my boat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.56,0:43:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,怪物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Monsters...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.62,0:43:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,记他账上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's on him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.01,0:45:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你撞得不轻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You took a hell of a hit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.10,0:45:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.71,0:45:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,终于…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At last...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.21,0:45:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,亚特兰蒂斯女王心爱的长子出现了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The firstborn of beloved Queen Atlanna.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.58,0:45:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.85,0:45:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.83,0:45:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我认识她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.84,0:45:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,可我不认识\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That makes one of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.61,0:45:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,当我的父母在战争中战死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When my parents fought in the wars...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.45,0:46:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 她收留了我 - 真是个圣人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- She took me in. - What a saint.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.91,0:46:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你胆敢这么说亚特兰娜女王？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You dare speak of Queen Atlanna that way?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.90,0:46:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你的女王把我扔在了我父亲的家门口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your Queen left me on my father's doorstep{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.97,0:46:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,然后再也没想过我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and never gave me another thought...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.22,0:46:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你母亲那么做是为了救你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your mother left you to save your life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.61,0:46:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你不知道她有多伤心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't imagine how it hurt her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.12,0:46:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,她付出了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What it cost her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.48,0:46:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,但你现在不是一个无助的孩子了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you're not a defenseless child now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.15,0:46:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,追着那个怪物到地面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would've been her responsibility...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.85,0:46:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,并阻止它 本来是她的责任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to follow that monster to the surface and stop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.35,0:46:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,现在 是你的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, it's yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.74,0:46:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,那我需要你帮我做件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I'm gonna need something from you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.05,0:47:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白了 母亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see, Mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.08,0:47:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白你为什么等到现在才召唤我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see why you waited to summon me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.37,0:47:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,氪星人的死让这个怯懦的世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That Kryptonian's death plunged this timid world...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.95,0:47:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,陷入恐惧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}into such terror.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.91,0:47:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,亚马逊人 亚特兰蒂斯人 独自战斗 独自陨落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Amazons. Atlanteans. Each stands, and falls, alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.83,0:47:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白 母亲 这一刻你等待得太久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know Mother. You've waited too long for the Unity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.86,0:48:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 但你会滋养我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know. But you will feed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.67,0:48:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,而我的放逐也将结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And my exile will come to an end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.49,0:48:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我会在新神之中找到我的位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will take my place among the New Gods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.55,0:48:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,找到最后一个母盒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find the last one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.86,0:48:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,它的力量将会净化这个世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Its power will cleanse this world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.83,0:48:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,为了统一之力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the Unity!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.19,0:48:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,为达克赛德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For Darkseid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.58,0:48:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Victor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.54,0:48:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Asshole!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.11,0:48:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,八起绑架 六起在大都会 两起在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eight kidnappings. 6 in Metropolis, 2 here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.91,0:48:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,所有的受害者都是星际实验室的工作人员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All the vics worked for STAR Labs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.30,0:49:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,被会飞的吸血鬼攻击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attacked by a flying vampire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.39,0:49:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,嫌犯是长着大獠牙的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suspect was a giant bat...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.65,0:49:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,巨型蝙蝠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with huge fangs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.30,0:49:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,受害者中有一个小孩 吓坏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of them was a little kid, scared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.38,0:49:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都没说只画了这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Won't say a word but drew this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.34,0:49:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这看起来… - 我知道这看起来像什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Looks like... - I know what it looks like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.03,0:49:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托 他在哥谭市打击罪犯二十年了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. You think he fights criminals for 20 years here...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.71,0:49:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得他会去大都会绑架八个人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then he goes to Metropolis and kidnaps eight people?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.41,0:49:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我今晚和他谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll talk to him tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.54,0:49:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,整个世界都疯了 吉姆 也许他也疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The world's gone crazy, Jim. Maybe he did, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.55,0:49:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你找到钢骨了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You find the Cyborg?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.22,0:49:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我们谈了谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We spoke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.04,0:49:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,给他点时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give him time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.22,0:49:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你一定是巴里了 我是戴安娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must be Barry. I'm Diana.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.63,0:49:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你好巴里 我是戴安娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi Barry, I'm Diana...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.18,0:49:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,说反了 抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not right. Great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.43,0:49:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,就我们几个了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So this is us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.67,0:49:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 就我们几个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. This is us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.83,0:49:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh! Awesome!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.16,0:49:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,那个是蝙蝠标记 那是你的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the Bat-signal. That's your...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.35,0:49:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.38,0:49:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那是给你的信号 看来我们得出发了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's your signal. That means we have to go now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.65,0:49:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没错 就是这个意思 - 太酷了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. That's what that means. - That's so cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.19,0:50:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你们有多少人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many of you are there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.34,0:50:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,没多少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.95,0:50:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,八个人在星际实验室附近被绑架了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eight people abducted from or near STAR Labs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.06,0:50:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这个是嫌疑人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's the potential perp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.18,0:50:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,类魔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Parademons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.93,0:50:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.05,0:50:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这些类魔一定闻到了母盒的气味\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The demons must have caught the scent of a Mother Box.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.60,0:50:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,它们把人抓走 看看他们知道什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They carried people away to find out what they know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.01,0:50:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那这八个人可能还活着 - 九个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So the eight might still be alive. - Nine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.34,0:50:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,星际实验室的负责人也被抓走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The head of STAR Labs was taken as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.76,0:50:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你想通了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You made it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.73,0:51:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,那么 附近一定有个巢穴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So then. There must be a nest nearby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.76,0:51:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我标注了大都会 哥谭市所有的目击地点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I plotted all the sightings in Metropolis, Gotham...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.21,0:51:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,看不出来什么花样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No pattern I can see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.66,0:51:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,地图上的线并不交汇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The lines on the map don't converge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.36,0:51:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,陆地上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On land.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.85,0:51:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,这些线都指向两座城市之间的布拉克斯顿岛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These lead back to Braxton Island, between the two cities.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.48,0:51:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,哥谭港口 这些是排气塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gotham Harbor. These are air vents...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.90,0:51:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,它们都通向大都会的地道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they all lead down to the tunnel from Metropolis...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.78,0:51:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,这个项目1929年就废弃了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}project that was abandoned in '29.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.68,0:51:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的认为…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you really think that...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.63,0:51:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,他们就… 他们就这么消失了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow. They just... They really just vanished.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.27,0:51:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,好没礼貌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's rude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.66,0:52:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 阿尔弗雷德 到哪儿了？- 布拉克斯顿岛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where are we, Alfred? - Braxton Island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.18,0:52:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你们应该在…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should be...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.62,0:52:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,隧道排气塔的正下方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}directly under the venting tower for the tunnel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.82,0:52:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,现在看你们的左边 应该有一段楼梯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, look to your left, you should see a staircase.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.83,0:52:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,爬上去就可以直接进入机房\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It will give you access to the machine room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.05,0:52:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,果然够直接\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Define access.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.42,0:52:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,一个一个过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One at a time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.71,0:52:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这桥可能…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bridge may not...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.79,0:52:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,撑不住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...hold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.01,0:52:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,把实话告诉我就行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just tell me the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.53,0:52:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,求你了 放我们走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, just let us go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.43,0:52:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我还有家人 - 回答错误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I have a family! - Wrong answer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.95,0:52:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,人类…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Humans...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.35,0:52:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你们恐惧的气味让我的士兵垂涎欲滴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The stench of your fear is making my soldiers hungry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.62,0:52:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我该喂它们吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shall I feed them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.19,0:52:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你靠近过母盒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been near the Mother Box.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.40,0:52:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你身上有它的气味 - 求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The scent is on you... - Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.79,0:52:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都有家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have families.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.51,0:52:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么每个人都告诉我这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why does everyone keep telling me that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.88,0:53:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,事情是这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Here's the thing...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.22,0:53:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧 我害怕虫子 还有…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, I'm afraid of bugs, and...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.17,0:53:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,枪 还有个子高的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guns. And obnoxiously tall people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.61,0:53:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,还有谋杀 我待不下去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And murder. I can't be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.04,0:53:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你们已经准备好去战斗了 这挺棒的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's really cool, you guys seem ready to do battle and stuff, but...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.51,0:53:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,但说实话 我从来没有战斗过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Full transparency, I've never done battle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.14,0:53:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我以前都是推别人一下就跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just push some people and run away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.98,0:53:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,救一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Save one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.63,0:53:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,一个？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.66,0:53:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,救一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Save one person.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.50,0:53:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,哪一个？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, which one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.80,0:53:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,别说话 别打架 进去 救一个出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't talk. Don't fight. Get in. Get one out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.38,0:53:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,然后呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.04,0:53:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你会明白的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.39,0:53:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.02,0:53:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,真没用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Useless!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.25,0:53:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,到你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.64,0:53:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我的母盒在哪里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is my Mother Box?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.09,0:53:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我死也不会告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll die before I tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.34,0:53:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,终于找到一个有骨气的人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At last, one that doesn't whine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.65,0:53:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,但我会让你尖叫的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you will scream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.48,0:54:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.92,0:54:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Victor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.64,0:54:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你是母盒孕育的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were born of her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.70,0:54:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,一个混沌的生物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A creature of chaos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.10,0:54:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不这样想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not how I see it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.54,0:54:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,不着急\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give it time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.36,0:54:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,亚马逊人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Amazon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.10,0:54:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.12,0:54:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,救一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Save one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.27,0:54:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这个是我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This one is mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.03,0:54:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你太高估自己了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You overestimate yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.98,0:55:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Child...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.89,0:55:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我的斧子上还滴着你姐妹的血呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My axe is still slick with the blood of your sisters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.45,0:55:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,阿尔弗雷德 我需要"夜行者"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alfred, I need the Nightcrawler.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.26,0:55:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,还以为你不需要呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you'd never ask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.32,0:55:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,夜行者已出发 开启远程操纵模式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crawler's on the way. Initiating remote mode.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.76,0:55:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You good?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.81,0:55:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,大厅的尽头应该有个楼梯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At the end of the hall there should be stairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.64,0:55:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.13,0:55:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.70,0:55:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,他在找再造引擎 是他的母盒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's after the change engine. His Mother Box.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.72,0:55:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你不能让他接近它 - 带他们去安全的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You have to keep him from it. - Help people get to safety.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.96,0:55:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 答应我 - 快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Promise me. - Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.48,0:56:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Finish her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.20,0:56:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 各位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry guys,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.73,0:56:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我没带剑来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't bring a sword.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.55,0:56:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 他真高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus. He is tall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.47,0:58:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,原来…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.42,0:58:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你体内流淌着旧神的血液\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have the blood of the Old Gods in you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.33,0:58:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,旧神已经灭亡了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Old Gods died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.52,0:58:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.26,0:58:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heads up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.28,0:58:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,谢了 阿尔弗雷德 不过后面的事交给我吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, Alfred. But I'll take it from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.57,0:59:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我认识你吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do I know you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.25,0:59:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,一群原始人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Primitive beings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.01,0:59:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我们上面是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are we under right now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.18,0:59:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,哥谭港口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gotham Harbor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.08,0:59:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你们最好躲开点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You all need to move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.41,0:59:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你带他出去 - 戴安娜 没有时间了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You get him out... - Diana, there's no time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.60,0:59:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,而且溺水也是我恐惧的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Also among my fears is drowning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.97,0:59:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你们真让人分心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are a distraction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.64,0:59:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,母亲在召唤我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mother is calling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.59,0:59:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,戴安娜 快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Diana, come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.81,1:00:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.19,1:00:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,再造引擎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The change engine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.13,1:00:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,他就这么逃了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did he just bail?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.50,1:00:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,数百万美元的工程毁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Millions in structural damage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.82,1:00:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你手段依旧啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You haven't lost your touch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.68,1:00:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,但是很高兴能看到你和别人相处得这么好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's good to see you playing well with others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.04,1:01:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,穿得像个蝙蝠吗？我喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dressed like a bat? I dig it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.90,1:01:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,也许只是暂时的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It may be temporary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.93,1:01:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那么…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.21,1:01:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,是什么让你改变主意了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What made you change your mind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.06,1:01:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,荒原狼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steppenwolf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.08,1:01:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,是他夺走了亚特兰蒂斯族的母盒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He took the Mother Box from Atlantis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.16,1:01:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,他现在只需要人类手里的最后一个盒子了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All he needs now is the last box of man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.73,1:01:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他还没有得到的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he doesn't already have it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.36,1:01:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,他还没有拿到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He doesn't have it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.91,1:02:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这里就像一个洞穴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like a cave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.45,1:02:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,像个蝙蝠洞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like a Batcave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.35,1:02:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,巴里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Barry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.17,1:02:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我父亲叫它再造引擎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father called it the change engine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.39,1:02:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这是英国人在一战期间发现的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was found by the British during World War I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.82,1:02:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,他们研究了它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They studied it...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.77,1:02:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,但是他们看不出制作的年代 它太古老了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but they couldn't even date it. It's so old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.92,1:02:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,它被搁置一边 直到超人去世的那晚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was shelved, until the night Superman died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.58,1:02:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,它就像圣诞节的彩灯一样亮了起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then she lit up like Christmas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.80,1:02:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,他们把它带到星际实验室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They brought it to STAR Labs...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.10,1:02:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我父亲认出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where my father recognized it...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.59,1:02:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这是一个永恒的能量矩阵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as a perpetual energy matrix.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.58,1:02:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,听起来很酷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That sounds cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.60,1:02:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我还以为这是个核弹呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought it was like a nuclear bomb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.64,1:02:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,母盒既能毁灭也能创造\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A Mother Box destroys as it creates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.81,1:02:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,它是生命的循环 但是快了一百万倍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a cycle of life, but a million times faster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.36,1:02:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我父亲认为它是能量无限化的关键\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father thought it was the key to unlimited energy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.50,1:03:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,新的公式 细胞再生…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}New formulas, cellular regeneration...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.20,1:03:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,但它很不稳定 难以控制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's too volatile to control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.17,1:03:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,他拿你做实验了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He used it on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.42,1:03:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我出了场事故\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was in an accident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.57,1:03:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我本来会死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should've died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.75,1:03:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我父亲觉得 他可以利用母盒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father thought that he could use the Mother Box to{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.26,1:03:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,用改装机械来重建我受损的身体部位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}rebuild the broken parts of me with a few cybernetic enhancements.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.69,1:03:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 他造出的是个活的机器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Instead, he built a living machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.65,1:03:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,可能比宿主还要强大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It may be stronger than its host.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.88,1:03:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,太多了 活性元素过多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too much. Too much life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.96,1:03:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你脑袋里在想什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's on your weird mind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.63,1:03:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,肌肉 协调性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Muscles. Coordination.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.94,1:03:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,细胞的基本完整性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Basic cellular integrity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.67,1:03:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,人类只能接受得了这么多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A human being can only absorb so much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.20,1:03:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,母盒本来是被用于重建一个星球的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Mother Box was designed to reshape a planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.63,1:03:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,所以？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.65,1:03:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,所以…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.71,1:03:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你比一个星球还要强大呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if you were stronger than a planet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.32,1:03:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你的细胞处于休眠状态 但是不会腐烂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your cells lying dormant, but incapable of decay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.09,1:03:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,如果让你处于一个导电领域…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you were in a conductive field...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.51,1:03:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,借用母盒上的能量…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A boost from the Mother Box...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.04,1:03:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,可以让他起死回生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}could bring "him" back to life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.84,1:03:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,氪星飞船上有一个羊膜舱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Kryptonian ship has an amniotic chamber...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.32,1:04:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是个完美的… - 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Which would be a perfect... - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.13,1:04:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 戴安娜 - 布鲁斯 不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Diana. - Bruce, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.12,1:04:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你根本不知道你面对的是何种能量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have no idea what kind of power you're dealing with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.49,1:04:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,即使只有一点机会…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even if there was a fraction of a chance...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.24,1:04:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,那又怎样？我们要养一个怪物吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That what? That we could raise a monster?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.14,1:04:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,像卢瑟那样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like Luthor did?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.01,1:04:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有卢瑟没有的科技…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have tech Luthor's never even seen...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.49,1:04:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,超人已经死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Superman is dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.18,1:04:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然我们都希望他没死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We all wish he weren't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.51,1:04:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不知道他现在处于什么状态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't know what state he's in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.49,1:04:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道我们没法带他回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We know we can't bring him back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.49,1:04:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,但是这有超越我们极限的科技\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But this is science beyond our limits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.26,1:04:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这正是科技的作用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that's what science is for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.69,1:04:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,做从没做过的事 让生命更美好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To do what's never been done. To make life better{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.46,1:04:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,或者毁灭生命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or to end it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.30,1:04:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,科技像其他力量一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Technology is like any other power...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.29,1:04:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,没有理性 没有心灵的话 它会毁灭我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Without reason, without heart... It destroys us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.54,1:04:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你在冒险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're risking lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.80,1:04:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,拿他们的和无数其他人的生命冒险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Theirs and maybe countless more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.81,1:04:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没时间慢慢研究了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't have time for a control group.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.04,1:04:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,有风险吗 是的 但是必须这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it a risk? Yes. But it's necessary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.18,1:04:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么 因为你的内疚吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why? Because of your guilt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.95,1:04:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,布鲁斯 我当时在那\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bruce, I was there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.14,1:04:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你没有害死超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't kill Superman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.40,1:04:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,有时候 即使是你…也得学会往前看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At some point, even you... have to learn to move on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.31,1:04:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,史蒂夫·特雷弗教你的吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did Steve Trevor tell you that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.79,1:05:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,超人 曾是这个世界的指路灯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Superman, was a beacon to the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.35,1:05:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么你不是？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why aren't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.50,1:05:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以激励人 戴安娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're an inspiration, Diana.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.59,1:05:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你不只是救人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't just save people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.64,1:05:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你让他们发现自己更美好的一面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You make them see their better selves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.48,1:05:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,可是 我从没听说过你…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And yet, I never heard of you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.22,1:05:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,直到卢瑟偷走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until Luthor lured you out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.53,1:05:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你死去的男朋友的照片 才引出了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by stealing a picture of your dead boyfriend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.37,1:05:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你自我封闭了一个世纪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You shut yourself down for a century.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.23,1:05:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,所以别跟我谈什么向前看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So let's not talk about me moving on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.67,1:05:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.80,1:05:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,如果她杀了你 我们替她打掩护的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That if she kills you, we'll cover for her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.14,1:05:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的力量不够\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are not enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.33,1:05:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我们每个人都有自己的弱点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Each of us in our own way has held back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.22,1:05:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以保证 荒原狼不会管什么伦理道德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I promise you, Steppenwolf is not out there talking about ethics.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.86,1:05:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,他想要毁灭整个世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's trying to burn down the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.60,1:05:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我们能阻止他的办法…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The way we're gonna stop him...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.45,1:05:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,就是利用它的能量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is by using his power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.09,1:05:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这份力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This power,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.34,1:05:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,来对抗他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}against him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.85,1:05:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我同意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I agree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.62,1:06:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不想看到母盒重新合并\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't like the idea of reintegrating with the Mother Box...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.08,1:06:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我在你犯浑的时候运算了成功率\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I was running the numbers while you're being an asshole,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.43,1:06:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我们成功复活他的几率很高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and there's a high probability that we can bring him back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.92,1:06:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,好 但他复活的场景最好像…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right, but we mean bring him back, in like a...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.20,1:06:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,太好啦 他复活啦 而不是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Yay! He's back!" way. Not in like a...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.62,1:06:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,像《宠物坟场》\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like a Pet Sematary{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.62,1:06:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}scenario?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.66,1:06:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,死忘的时候都会失去些东西 超人也不例外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You lose something when you die. Even Superman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.74,1:06:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,也许不是他的理智 而是他的灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe not his mind. Maybe his soul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.36,1:06:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我会想个应急方案的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll have a contingency plan for that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.21,1:06:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他醒来第一眼看到的就是你…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he wakes up and you're the first thing he sees...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.37,1:06:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你确实需要应急方案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll need one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.19,1:06:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这真有趣 虽然没有继续下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well that was fun while it didn't last.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.69,1:06:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,她可以阻止我的 我实际上是在激她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She could've stopped me. I practically dared her to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.11,1:06:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我不明白你为什么要一直逼她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't see why you're pushing her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.06,1:06:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要增强信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll have to boost the signal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.60,1:06:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,通过蝙蝠车的音响放出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put it through the Batmobile's speakers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.29,1:06:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你又转移话题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you're changing the subject.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.69,1:06:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我有应急方案 - 什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I have a contingency. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.36,1:07:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,戴安娜说的是对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Diana was right about the risk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.11,1:07:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,如果这个计划行不通 我们就得拿出大家伙了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If the plan goes south, we're gonna bring in the big guns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.14,1:07:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,但 那可是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But that's not...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.57,1:07:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,非同小可的大家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those are very big guns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.95,1:07:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你在这里有一个团队了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got a team here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.39,1:07:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,带领这个团队 超人会比我更出色\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Superman could bring this team together better than I ever could.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.15,1:07:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他的力量… - 这无关强壮与力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- His strength... - It doesn't matter how strong you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.38,1:07:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,或者你所拥有的超能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or what abilities you might have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.09,1:07:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,他比我更有人性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was more human than I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.29,1:07:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,他在这个世界生活过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He lived in this world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.21,1:07:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,爱过某人 有过工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fell in love, had a job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.72,1:07:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,就算抛开那些超能力不谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In spite of all that power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.19,1:07:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,世界也需要超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The world needs Superman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.04,1:07:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这个团队也需要克拉克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the team needs Clark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.39,1:07:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,那克拉克需要什么呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what does Clark need?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.18,1:07:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,也许他已经安息了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe he's at peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.92,1:07:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,他会没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll get over it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.90,1:07:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道吗 我其实可以很快挖完的 只是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I can do this a lot faster. I just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.44,1:08:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我感觉这样有点不敬 是不是有点奇怪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it weird that it feels disrespectful?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.66,1:08:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.43,1:08:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你有没有觉得…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you feel a sense of confidence{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.22,1:08:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在做一件极其错误的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that we're not doing something horribly wrong{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.99,1:08:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怖的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and macabre here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.83,1:08:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.14,1:08:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好吧那为什么… - 因为我看到过荒原狼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay then why are... - Because I saw Steppenwolf up close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.35,1:08:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,戴安娜告我们的故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The stories Diana told us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.61,1:08:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我相信是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I believe them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.83,1:08:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我们会阻止他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we're gonna stop him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.56,1:08:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,计划是这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.81,1:08:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,计划是这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the plan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.55,1:08:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我们还没有到… 跨越种族那一步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, we're not ready for... Racially charged...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.83,1:08:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你是被闪电击中了 对吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got struck by lightning, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.50,1:08:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,对 长话短说 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah... That's the abridged version.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.20,1:08:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那你… - 爆炸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And you... - Explosion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.32,1:08:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,在一间实验室醒来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Woke up in a lab.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.72,1:08:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都是意外的结果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're, we're the accidents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.64,1:08:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,是 我们都是意外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that's us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.82,1:08:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,来碰一个吧 不要吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! No. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.41,1:09:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我们正在接近氪星飞船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're approaching the Kryptonian ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.61,1:09:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,预计30秒后到达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ETA, 30 seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.08,1:09:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我是为他来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm here for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.67,1:09:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我发誓 我永远不会… - 省省吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I swear, I would never... - Save it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.94,1:09:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好了 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay. - Okay!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.53,1:09:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.54,1:10:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is amazing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.20,1:10:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这太疯狂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.75,1:10:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在才觉得疯狂吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, now it's crazy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.17,1:10:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你们这帮疯子最好知道自己在干吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You lunatics better know what you're doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.35,1:11:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,莱克斯·卢瑟烧毁了电路 才让他的怪物活过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lex Luthor fried the circuits bringing his creature to life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.73,1:11:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,现在的电压不足以唤醒盒子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's not enough charge to wake the Box.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.81,1:11:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我也许能做到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I might be able to do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.03,1:11:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我也许可以启动它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I might be able to jumpstart it, I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.44,1:11:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我有足够远的距离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I can get enough distance...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.83,1:11:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以制造一个足够强大的电流\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can conduct a significant electrical current.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.82,1:11:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,也许可以唤醒盒子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I might be able to wake the Box,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.03,1:11:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,如果 确定要这样的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if that's still what we want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.16,1:11:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须得试试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to try.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.38,1:11:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是最远了 所以…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This must be the end of the line, so...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.55,1:11:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我就位了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm in position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.09,1:11:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,母盒已经准备好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Mother Box is ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.39,1:11:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须在它接触液体的那一瞬间 把电导进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to charge it the moment it touches the fluid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.20,1:11:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,五\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.11,1:11:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,五\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.86,1:11:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,戴安娜说得对 这不是个好主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Diana's right. This is a bad idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.09,1:11:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,四\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Four.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.10,1:11:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,四\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Four.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.00,1:11:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,三\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.21,1:11:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,三\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.37,1:11:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,二\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.07,1:11:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,二\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.77,1:11:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.31,1:13:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,请求支援…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give us an ETA on all additional units...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.21,1:13:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,他复活了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.04,1:14:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,他不太对劲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.96,1:14:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,他在扫描我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's scanning us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.71,1:14:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.37,1:14:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,亚瑟 你放松 你的肾上腺素现在狂飙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arthur, you need to relax. Your adrenaline's spiking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.85,1:14:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,因为他不太对劲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because he's not all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.07,1:14:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.99,1:14:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要不要鞠躬？或者是把肚子露给他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Should we bow? Or show our bellies?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.89,1:14:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Victor...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.74,1:14:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多 停下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Victor, stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.43,1:14:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 糟糕 - 你在干嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Shit! - What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.86,1:14:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Victor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.52,1:14:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是我盔甲的防御机制 - 不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's my armor's defense system... - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.02,1:14:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,检测到他就增强了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's stronger since the interface...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.34,1:14:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我控制不了它 - 维克多 不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I can't control it. - Victor, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.01,1:14:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 把它关掉 - 想想开心的事 维克多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Shut it off! - Think of happy thoughts, Victor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.61,1:14:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,凯·艾尔 不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kal-El, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.19,1:14:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,他不清醒 他不知道自己是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's confused, he doesn't know who he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.90,1:14:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这下成《宠物公墓》了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pet Sematary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.81,1:15:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,亚瑟 我们得控制住他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arthur, we need to restrain him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.82,1:15:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.47,1:15:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,凯·艾尔 氪星最后的儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kal-El, the last son of Krypton...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.00,1:15:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,记住你是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember who you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.98,1:15:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我你是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me who you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.97,1:16:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clark...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.33,1:16:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我认识你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.26,1:16:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托 请别逼我这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please don't make me do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.50,1:17:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,阿尔弗雷德 我需要大家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alfred, I need the big gun...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.76,1:17:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是你干的 - 我必须如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You did this... - I had to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.57,1:17:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你不让我活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won't let me live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.50,1:17:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,也不让我死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won't let me die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.96,1:17:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,世界需要你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The world needs you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.24,1:17:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,但它需要你吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But does it need you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.81,1:17:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.19,1:17:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你也会流血吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you bleed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.81,1:17:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.50,1:17:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.26,1:18:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,别这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.60,1:18:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,求求你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.02,1:18:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不要这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.98,1:18:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.31,1:18:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.23,1:18:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go. Yeah...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.05,1:18:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 我肯定哪里流血了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Something's definitely bleeding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.76,1:19:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,母盒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Mother Box.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.50,1:19:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,他拿到最后一个了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He has the last one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.95,1:19:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你把我们带到这里来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You brought us here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.10,1:19:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你还记得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You remembered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.16,1:19:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我们的家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.86,1:19:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你真好闻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You smell good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.12,1:19:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我以前不好闻吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did I not before?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.48,1:20:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,别这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.95,1:20:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我们刚刚被痛扁了一顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We just got our asses handed to us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.84,1:20:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,荒原狼拿到了第三个盒子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Steppenwolf has got the third Box.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.85,1:20:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会找回来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we find them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.15,1:20:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,如果这些盒子彼此靠近一些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If the Boxes are even close to each other{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.28,1:20:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定会有某种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there's going to be some kind{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.02,1:20:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,能量激增\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of energy surge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.18,1:20:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,荒原狼肯定会把它们藏到难以探测的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Steppenwolf's gonna be keeping them somewhere where they don't read.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.54,1:20:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,没有网络 没有卫星信号覆盖的区域\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No internet, no satellite coverage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.63,1:20:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,那范围可是缩小了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That narrows it down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.21,1:20:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,还不够小\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.38,1:20:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,就看 是你找不到呢…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, you can't find them...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.33,1:20:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,还是你根本不想找\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...or maybe you don't want to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.25,1:20:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,亚瑟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arthur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.85,1:20:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这可真是摆脱超人的好办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that was a great way to get rid of Superman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.74,1:20:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,哥们 我不是故意的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man, I'm not doing this on purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.13,1:20:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,对 因为你控制不了你身上的机器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right. Because you can't control the machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.80,1:20:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在提一下我低血糖的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right, so is this a bad time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.95,1:20:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是不太好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to bring up my blood sugar?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.74,1:20:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的好饿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very hungry...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.01,1:20:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Victor...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.94,1:20:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你能找到那些盒子的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can find the Boxes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.54,1:20:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你跟他们共享能量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You share their energy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.77,1:20:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道这很吓人 但是如果你出事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know it's frightening. But if you go under...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.16,1:20:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我发誓 我们会救你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I promise, we will pull you back out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.16,1:21:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我干活儿的时候让那个美人鱼离我远点就行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just keep the Little Merman away from me while I work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.57,1:21:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,巴里 去找阿尔弗雷德吃点东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Barry, go find Alfred in the pantry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.03,1:21:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,然后回来就连线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then come back, get online.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.55,1:21:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,大家互相核对一下进展\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody check everybody else's work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.52,1:21:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.89,1:21:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我想知道 你能不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just wonder if you could, put out a,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.26,1:21:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,就是 你不是水生的嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you were, an aquatic...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.35,1:21:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你懂的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.00,1:21:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你能不能 跟鱼说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you, talk to fish?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.71,1:21:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,是水在跟鱼说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The water does the talking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.17,1:21:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.15,1:21:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,如果水流有什么异常 我都会知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If the current comes in strange, I'm gonna point the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.57,1:21:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.10,1:22:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.21,1:22:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.38,1:22:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,只是有点脱臼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't this a little out of place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.88,1:22:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉克的反应跟你料想的一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, Clark seemed to share your view on being woken up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.68,1:22:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,他差点就杀了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He could've killed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.55,1:22:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,他能回来 我受点罪也值得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was willing to make the trade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.30,1:22:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,还把露易丝带过来了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And bringing in Lois Lane?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.79,1:22:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,在机库里 你跟我说良知的那些话 你还记得吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember what you told me about heart, in the hangar?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.00,1:22:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你肯定…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I bet you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.96,1:22:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,认为我没听进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}thought I wasn't listening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.65,1:22:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.42,1:22:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道自己不可能永远当蝙蝠侠的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know you can't do this forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.37,1:22:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在都已经很勉强了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can barely do it now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.97,1:22:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,荒原狼来了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steppenwolf...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.99,1:22:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的职责\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.07,1:22:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,是我的职责\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's my job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.43,1:22:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,一直以来 我都没尽过职\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I haven't been doing it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.83,1:22:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,一直在被动应对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been reacting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.86,1:22:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,不是主动出击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not leading.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.24,1:22:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你说的那些关于史蒂夫·特雷弗的话…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, what you said about Steve Trevor...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.04,1:22:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我不该提起那些事情 抱歉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That wasn't my business. I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.50,1:22:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你是想用激将法让我来领导团队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were pushing me to lead the team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.87,1:23:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,但是决策失误的话会死人的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But leaders get people killed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.01,1:23:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,战斗时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I fought...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.46,1:23:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我从来…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Always...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.20,1:23:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,都不会退缩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I was needed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.67,1:23:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,但要去领导团队 走到大家面前…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But to lead, to step into the light...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.59,1:23:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And to say to people:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.61,1:23:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,这值得去牺牲自己的生命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"This is worth your life?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.38,1:23:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,要是我搞砸了的话…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When it's your fault...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.27,1:23:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,大家就都成了史蒂夫·特雷弗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're all Steve Trevor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.68,1:23:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只要撑过今晚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We make it through tonight...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.47,1:23:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,以后你就可以永远待在黑暗中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can stay in the shadows forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.75,1:23:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,打扮成蝙蝠的样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dressed up like a bat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.23,1:23:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会告你侵权的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't even sue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.64,1:23:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,前提是…我们能撑过今晚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If... we get through the night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.89,1:23:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.62,1:24:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你把我们带到这里来 可你几乎没在家里待过一分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You brought us here, but you've hardly spent a minute in the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.05,1:24:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know... I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.24,1:24:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是需要缓一缓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just got out of a wooden box.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.74,1:24:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,重新回来这个世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was it like...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.85,1:24:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coming back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.19,1:24:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,很痒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Itchy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.25,1:24:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我 老实说…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, honestly...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.56,1:24:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉怪怪的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weird,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.59,1:24:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,很多地方都很怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in so many ways.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.18,1:24:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 但主要的是… - 我不够坚强\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But, mostly just - I wasn't strong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.40,1:24:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我没能…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.32,1:24:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你一定对我很失望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You would've been very disappointed in me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.30,1:24:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wasn't...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.12,1:24:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我还是露易丝·莲恩 一个尽责的记者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lois Lane, dedicated reporter. I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.39,1:24:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.15,1:24:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.12,1:24:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我像个白痴一样 离开了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm the idiot who left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.93,1:24:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'm back now...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.17,1:24:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我会让一切重回正轨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm gonna make things right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.81,1:25:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你把妈妈也叫过来了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You called mom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.60,1:25:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.34,1:25:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.99,1:25:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我还以为你需要更长时间来…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was hoping it was gonna take you longer to...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.77,1:25:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,恢复\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...recover.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.08,1:25:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.40,1:25:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,因为现在我必须送你走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because now, I have to send you away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.29,1:25:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,布鲁斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bruce.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.79,1:25:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,他需要你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He needs you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.58,1:25:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,拯救这个世界的命运 我还以为你们都商量好了 他还…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fate of the world. I think that's the deal. He was...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.90,1:25:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,挺紧张的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pretty tense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.56,1:25:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,看来我确实还欠他一命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I guess I do owe him one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.67,1:25:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.01,1:25:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这次不准死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But no dying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.29,1:25:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,独家新闻要留给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I get the exclusive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.59,1:25:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,遵命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, madam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.42,1:26:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真的是你吗 - 真的是我 妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're really you? - I'm really me, ma.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.43,1:26:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,终于齐了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At last.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.59,1:26:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,统一之力万岁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Praise to the Unity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.55,1:26:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,合并吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The three is one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.32,1:27:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,恐惧之母万岁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Praise to the Mother of Horrors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.53,1:27:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,荒原狼在那里吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is Steppenwolf there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.69,1:27:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.34,1:27:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,在波扎尔诺夫 俄罗斯北部地区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Porzenov. In Northern Russia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.40,1:27:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,是个核电站\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Nuclear Plant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.88,1:27:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,30年前发生了一次事故\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Had a meltdown 30 years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.77,1:27:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,还是有些人想搬回去定居\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There have been some attempts to resettle nearby...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.03,1:27:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,但是那里看起来十分的荒凉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it looks like really rough sledding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.62,1:27:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,谁愿意去这种地方扎根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who picks this place to put down roots?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.05,1:28:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,那些被全世界抛弃的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People that are making it count everywhere else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.66,1:28:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,地球将发生变化…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Earth starts changing...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.47,1:28:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,会从那里开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it'll hit them first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.05,1:28:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还剩多少时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long have we got?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.49,1:28:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,几个小时吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A few hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.02,1:28:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,普通的交通工具可飞不到那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Transport won't fly that fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.92,1:28:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,交给我吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It will for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.81,1:28:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,统一之力让三个母盒精确同步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Unity brings all three boxes together in perfect sync.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.48,1:29:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,它的能量不断汇聚 直到溢出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Its power builds until it can't be contained.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.83,1:29:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们要是能让每个盒子之间有一点延迟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if I can cause a delay between each box,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.01,1:29:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,哪怕延迟一纳秒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}even for a nanosecond...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.49,1:29:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,它的能量就会泻出形成一个闭环\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Its energy will cascade. Form a loop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.04,1:29:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,然后它们之间就会互相侵蚀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they'll feed on each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.29,1:29:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,就这么简单吗？直接分开就行了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that's it? We just pull them apart?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.36,1:29:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么可怕的后果吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No fuss, no muss?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.76,1:29:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,分开母盒的时候还是会引发大规模的能量振荡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Separating the boxes is still gonna cause a massive surge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.66,1:29:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to be there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.21,1:29:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,但你们得快点想办法撤离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you guys should think about getting clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.86,1:29:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是不会丢下你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're with you 'till it's done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.33,1:29:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,说实话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honestly...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.91,1:29:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕还没到那个时候我们就全死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we're gonna be dead way before that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.33,1:29:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你们知道吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you know what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.72,1:29:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我倒不介意 这是个光荣的死法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't mind. It's an honorable end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.90,1:29:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们必须阻止荒原狼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we've gotta shut Steppenwolf down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.79,1:29:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,超人是不会来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Superman's a no-show.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.48,1:29:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你又没有超能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got no powers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.54,1:29:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,无意冒犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No offense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.57,1:29:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这家伙也可能是个内鬼 谁知道呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This guy might be working for the enemy. We don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.17,1:29:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,而你经常绊倒自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're tripping over your feet, and mine...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.67,1:29:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你太动人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gorgeous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.94,1:29:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,也很勇猛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And fierce...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.02,1:29:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,很强壮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And strong. And...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.63,1:29:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道我的族人曾经和亚马逊族交战过 但…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know we went to war with the Amazons, but...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.21,1:29:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不过那时候还没有我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but that was before my time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.45,1:29:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你们猜怎么着？我不想死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what? I don't wanna die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.93,1:29:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我很年轻 我也还没活够呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm young. There's shit that I wanna do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.69,1:29:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是觉得…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just feel like...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.73,1:29:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我还没有真正的拥抱过海洋和陆地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't really embrace the sea or the land.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.55,1:29:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,到现在我还是孤身一人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been a loner my whole life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.17,1:30:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,能成为伟大行动的一部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But being part of something bigger,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.81,1:30:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,就像这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}like this...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.15,1:30:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,也许我害怕是因为…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe I'm scared because...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.56,1:30:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我注定要…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm meant to...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.48,1:30:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得你的发言很精彩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think that was beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.57,1:30:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你要是还敢提这件事 我就把你扔到海里喂鱼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You say a word about this, and I'll meet every prawn I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.58,1:30:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,他说到我们都会死之后 我就什么都没听到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I honestly didn't hear anything after "We're all gonna die."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.60,1:30:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,让他们来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let them come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.29,1:31:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我会拆了那座塔 来突破防护罩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna take out that tower and knock down that shield dome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.28,1:31:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你们去阻止荒原狼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You get to Steppenwolf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.64,1:31:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,不用等我 完成任务就行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't wait for me. Just do the job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.80,1:32:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 阿尔弗雷德 准备开始广播\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright, Alfred. Are we set to broadcast?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.16,1:32:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,马上播放你最爱的金曲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Playing all your favorite hits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.94,1:32:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,来啊 追我啊 臭虫们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, follow me, you damn insects.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.48,1:32:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他们来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.50,1:32:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,他们全来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're all coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.30,1:32:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我们好像没考虑到这种情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We might not have thought this through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.45,1:33:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,他在吸引火力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's clearing the field.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.53,1:33:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,他顶不过三分钟的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He won't last three minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.30,1:33:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们就好好利用这三分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then let's use them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.07,1:33:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,听我指挥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On my lead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.88,1:34:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,妈的一群害虫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.67,1:34:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不用谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.79,1:34:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,计划可不是这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't the plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.14,1:34:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,确实不是 韦恩少爷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Master Wayne...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.10,1:34:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是团队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this is the team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.37,1:34:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,要怪就怪女侠吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, blame the lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.81,1:34:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是想扔下你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We would've left you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.55,1:34:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,但是她都没要我们投票\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but she didn't ask for our vote.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.00,1:34:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你的天才计划 就是送死？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So your genius move is dying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.76,1:34:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你可真是疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really are out of your mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.54,1:34:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,拿鱼叉打仗的人才叫疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not the one who brought a pitchfork.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.74,1:35:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- 事情还没结束呢 - 这才像话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ride aingt over yet. - My man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.75,1:36:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,征服就是这个样子吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this what conquering is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.91,1:36:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,连干一架都不敢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hiding from the fight?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.17,1:36:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.48,1:36:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你们都归我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're all mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.09,1:36:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢让我搭便车 - 没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thanks for the lift. - Yeah, no problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.92,1:36:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你能搞定吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.81,1:36:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这些家伙不停的来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These things are gonna keep coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.63,1:36:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你搞技术活 我来除虫吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You get technical. I'm on bug duty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.42,1:36:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,开始吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.37,1:36:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,对 好恶心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes! That's gross.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.28,1:37:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.23,1:37:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,这可不是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is not...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:28.59,1:37:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,现在 你明白了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now,do you see it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.29,1:37:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不管你周围是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever you're in the middle of...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.43,1:37:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,它都蔓延好几英里了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's spreading for miles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:54.37,1:37:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,卫星显示有平民在向东逃跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Satellites show civilians moving east.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.62,1:37:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,他们可能逃不出去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're not gonna make it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.30,1:38:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,巴里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Barry...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.60,1:38:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要你跑一趟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you to take a walk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.93,1:38:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,天哪 希望这是东边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God, I hope this is east.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.19,1:38:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,戴安娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Diana.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.46,1:39:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你没资格触碰 母亲…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not worthy, to touch. Mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.66,1:39:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,她就是力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.36,1:39:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,而力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And power,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.37,1:39:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,就是唯一的法则\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is the only law.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.64,1:39:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你们太渺小 看不到真理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're all too weak to see the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.03,1:39:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:17.75,1:39:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我相信真理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe in truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.66,1:39:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,但我刚好也喜欢正义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'm also a big fan of justice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.32,1:39:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:36.56,1:39:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,氪星人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kryptonian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.80,1:39:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,那 我能帮上什么忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So. How do I help?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.09,1:39:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我们给他争取时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We buy him some time,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.35,1:40:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,他就可以阻止母盒毁灭整个地球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he can stop that box from destroying all life on Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.97,1:40:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,希望如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.13,1:40:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我知道你复活我 不是因为爱上我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I knew you didn't bring me back because you like me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.17,1:40:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我不…不是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't... not...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.52,1:40:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,平民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Civilians...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:15.48,1:40:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 巴里去了 - 人太多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Barry is headed... - There's too many of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.81,1:40:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,对 这绝对是东面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah. This is definitely east.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.57,1:40:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,小乌龟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Slowpoke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.16,1:40:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,要比赛是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, it's on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.39,1:40:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,右边的归我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take the ones on the right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:58.04,1:40:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.71,1:41:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,抓好 抓好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on. Hold on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.89,1:41:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,陀思妥耶夫斯基\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dostoyevski!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:38.32,1:41:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,这家伙还在烦你吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this guy still bothering you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:54.30,1:41:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Superman!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.88,1:41:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得把这些东西分开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta pull these things apart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:57.55,1:41:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,再等几秒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A couple of more seconds...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.93,1:42:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你就会看到机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you'll see her opening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:00.77,1:42:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,会有冲击波吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any blow-back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.84,1:42:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,很强\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Big-time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:03.36,1:42:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我觉得我们承受的住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I think we can take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:04.80,1:42:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.72,1:42:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我还是蛮喜欢活着的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I really like being alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.32,1:42:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So do I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.85,1:42:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:41.02,1:42:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我收回那句话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I take it back...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.18,1:42:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我想死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanna die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:48.62,1:42:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,哥们 我的脚趾好痛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man, my toes hurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.67,1:42:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我都不明白脚趾疼的物理原理是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't even understand the physics of how my toes hurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:56.19,1:42:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,小朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.60,1:42:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我在和一帮小朋友工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I work with children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.50,1:43:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你们看到外面发生的情况了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you guys seen what's going on outside?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:13.37,1:43:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我是世界的终结者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am the end of worlds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:18.61,1:43:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你好大胆子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:20.24,1:43:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,居然敢对抗我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to defy me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:23.71,1:43:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,世界…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This world...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.38,1:43:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,将属于我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is my right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:27.18,1:43:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你永远不会…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will never...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:48.39,1:43:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.13,1:43:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,这不可能…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This cannot be...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:52.23,1:43:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,记得这味道吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Recognize that smell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.53,1:43:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,恐惧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:00.16,1:44:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,不 退下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Leave me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.43,1:44:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,给我滚开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get off me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:06.98,1:44:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我命令你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I command you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.34,1:44:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:13.36,1:44:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:16.01,1:44:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我要杀了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll kill you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:18.02,1:44:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我要把你们全杀了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll kill you all!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:45.28,1:44:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,真棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Booyah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:11.80,1:45:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,还好我没错过这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Glad I didn't miss this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:14.82,1:45:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So am I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:16.74,1:45:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:17.96,1:45:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,现在她开心了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now she's glad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.08,1:45:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你布鲁斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Bruce.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.86,1:45:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,真不知该如何谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not enough for what you did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.26,1:45:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我犯了个错误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did a mistake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:55.38,1:45:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,弥补而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:05.63,1:46:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么从银行把房子赎回来的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you get the house back from the bank?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:08.57,1:46:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我把银行买了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I bought the bank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:12.67,1:46:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,整个银行？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The whole bank?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.73,1:46:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我说话你得慢一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Slow your reflex with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:15.35,1:46:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我老了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:20.27,1:46:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:21.56,1:46:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这是犯罪实验室里最糟糕的工作了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's actually the,worst job you can get in a crime lab.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:24.56,1:46:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,但…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, uh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:25.52,1:46:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我迈出了第一步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My foot's in the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:27.30,1:46:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,对 有个朋友推荐的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. I got a recommendation from a friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:30.12,1:46:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这是份正经工作吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is like a "job" job?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.46,1:46:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,正经工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Job" job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:37.35,1:46:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,真不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at you go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:56.89,1:46:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,黑暗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Darkness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.32,1:47:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,真正的黑暗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The truest darkness...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:00.22,1:47:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,并不是没有光明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is not the absence of light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:03.94,1:47:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,而是深信光明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is the conviction that the light...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:05.88,1:47:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不会重新出现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...will never return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:08.12,1:47:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,大概有150英尺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Must be 150 feet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:10.80,1:47:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Must be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:13.38,1:47:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,大圆桌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Big round table.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:15.24,1:47:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,六把椅子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Six chairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:16.33,1:47:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,就在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:18.45,1:47:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,会有更多位置的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With room for more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:22.48,1:47:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,会有更多位置的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With room for more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:25.67,1:47:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,但是光明总会回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the light always returns...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:28.27,1:47:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,带给我们那些熟悉的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to show us things familiar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:31.71,1:47:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:33.44,1:47:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:36.12,1:47:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,还有完全陌生的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And things entirely new.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:39.09,1:47:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,或者长期被忽视的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or long overlooked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:46.15,1:47:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们看到新的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It shows us new possibilities...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:48.68,1:47:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,鼓励我们去追随\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And challenges us to pursue them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:52.68,1:47:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,对 杰瑞·摩纳思科是主谋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. And Johnny Menasco runs the whole thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:54.66,1:47:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,两年前毕尔巴鄂的案子就是他干的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, he did the Bilbao job 2 years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:56.60,1:47:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,还有克罗伊登的那些储藏箱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As are all the storage in Croydon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:58.50,1:48:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那个比利时人 - 对的 就是那个比利时人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The Belgian. - Right, yeah. The Belgian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.19,1:48:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这次 英雄们从黑暗中挺身而出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This time, the light shone on the heroes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:03.71,1:48:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的光芒照亮了人世\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coming out of the shadows{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:05.03,1:48:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我们 我们不再孤单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to tell us we won't be alone again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:09.58,1:48:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,当时黑暗那么强大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our darkness was deep...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:11.97,1:48:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,仿佛吞噬一切希望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and seemed to swallow all hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:14.79,1:48:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,但是这些英雄们一直都在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But these heroes were here the whole time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:18.49,1:48:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,时刻提醒我们 希望是真实的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To remind us that hope is real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:21.87,1:48:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,可以看见的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That you can see it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:27.98,1:48:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你需要做的只是抬头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All you have to do is look...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:32.99,1:48:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,仰望天空\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Up in the sky...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:32.87,1:49:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你愿意这么做 我感激不尽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't tell you how much I appreciate you doing this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:35.95,1:49:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道 巴里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know, Barry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:38.08,1:49:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我自己也很好奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm curious myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:39.14,1:49:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,对 这可不是比赛 知道吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. And it's not like a competition, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:41.10,1:49:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 这…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:42.28,1:49:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is a competition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:43.44,1:49:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,但这可不是为了彰显男子气概\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's not like a macho-measuring thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:46.61,1:49:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,但如果我赢了 你就退出团队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if I win, you're off the team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:54.03,1:49:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,不是啦…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:57.06,1:49:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我赢了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I win...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:58.89,1:50:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,布鲁斯说 你要请大家去吃早午餐？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bruce said something about you having to take us all to "brunch"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:02.13,1:50:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧 真令人寒心 他背叛了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, see, now that's cold. That's a betrayal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:04.84,1:50:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我感觉好受伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel stung by that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:08.08,1:50:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 但是如果我赢了 我可以告诉所有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. But if I win, I get to tell everyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:09.91,1:50:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,一言为定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:11.90,1:50:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,哪个海岸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which coast?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:13.57,1:50:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道 我还没见过太平洋呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I've never seen the pacific.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:16.83,1:50:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是那边 因为…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which is that way, because...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:19.91,1:50:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,太阳 就在…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The sun, and it's...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:08.46,1:58:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,快来 卢瑟 该走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Luthor. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:11.85,1:58:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,卢瑟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Luthor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:22.26,1:58:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 别闹了 卢瑟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, stop jerking around, Luthor,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:23.81,1:58:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,别逼我进来逮你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or I'm gonna have to come in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:58.82,1:59:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你来了 欢迎上船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah! There he is. Welcome aboard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:00.65,1:59:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,要先来杯香槟吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Care for a glass of Goût de Diamants?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:02.75,1:59:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我在庆祝超人的回归\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was just celebrating God's return{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:04.56,1:59:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,从地下又飞上了天空\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}out of the ground and back up into the sky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:07.50,1:59:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,他和他那帮怪朋友整出来一个什么联盟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He and his odd little friends are forming some sort of league.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:10.84,1:59:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你最好别浪费我的时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You better not be wasting my time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:12.74,1:59:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,当然不 我的事情还多呢 还有更重要的事情要去做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I have too much to live for and more important things to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:16.49,1:59:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得让这场竞争公平点 威尔逊先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to level the playing field, Mr. Wilson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:20.10,1:59:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,长话短说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To put it plainly{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:23.17,1:59:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是不是也应该组建一个自己联盟呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}shouldn't we have a league of our own?{\r}
